---
title: P360 archive contract-boundary sequence
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant Caller as Use case caller
    participant Factory as P360_AdapterFactory
    participant Orchestrator as AAREG_ArchiveApplicationOrchestrator
    participant Adapter as P360_IArchiveAdapter
    participant Client as P360_IRpcClient
    participant Boundary as Live SIF RPC boundary

    Caller->>Factory: Resolve adapter from org setting
    alt Use_Mock_Transport__c = true
        Factory-->>Caller: P360_StubArchiveAdapter
    else Mock mode disabled
        Factory-->>Caller: P360_ArchiveAdapter(P360_RpcClient)
    end
    Caller->>Orchestrator: archive(command)
    alt command is null or required values missing
        Orchestrator-->>Caller: P360_ContractException
    else command is valid
        Orchestrator->>Adapter: archive(request)
        alt Explicit mock mode
            Adapter-->>Orchestrator: controlled success response
        else Live transport boundary
            Adapter->>Client: archive RPC request
            Client-->>Adapter: pending live response contract
            Adapter-->>Orchestrator: response or classified exception
        end
        Orchestrator-->>Caller: AAREG_ArchiveApplicationResult
    end

    Note over Client,Boundary: Live endpoint, authentication, payload and response mapping remain externally blocked
